<style>
.itorots{padding:0;background:var(--it-surface);border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--it-border)}
[data-theme="dark"] .itorots{background:#111113;border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,.07)}
.itorots__inner{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:stretch}
.itorots__item{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex:1;
  padding:18px 24px;
  border-right:0.5px solid var(--it-border);
  transition:background .2s;
}
.itorots__item:last-child{border-right:none}
.itorots__item:hover{background:var(--it-surface2)}
[data-theme="dark"] .itorots__item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
.itorots__icon{
  width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;
  background:rgba(212,175,55,.08);
  border:0.5px solid rgba(212,175,55,.22);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
}
.itorots__icon svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:#d4af37;flex-shrink:0}
.itorots__text{min-width:0}
.itorots__label{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--it-text,#1a1a1a);margin:0 0 2px;line-height:1.2}
[data-theme="dark"] .itorots__label{color:var(--it-text,#ede9e2)}
.itorots__sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--it-muted,#666);margin:0;line-height:1.35;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
[data-theme="dark"] .itorots__sub{color:var(--it-muted,#888)}
@media(max-width:899px){
  .itorots__inner{flex-wrap:wrap}
  .itorots__item{flex:1 0 50%;border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--it-border)}
  .itorots__item:nth-child(even){border-right:none}
  .itorots__item:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:none}
  .itorots__sub{white-space:normal}
}
@media(max-width:479px){
  .itorots__item{flex:1 0 100%;border-right:none}
  .itorots__item:last-child{border-bottom:none}
}
</style>

<div class="itorots" role="region" aria-label="Ventajas de compra">
  <div class="itorots__inner">
    <div class="itorots__item">
      <div class="itorots__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="2"/><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="itorots__text">
        <p class="itorots__label">Envío GRATIS</p>
        <p class="itorots__sub">Entrega 24–48h &middot; Correos &middot; Península y Baleares</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="itorots__item">
      <div class="itorots__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="itorots__text">
        <p class="itorots__label">Garantía hasta 3 años</p>
        <p class="itorots__sub">Sin letra pequeña &middot; Reparación o cambio</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="itorots__item">
      <div class="itorots__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="itorots__text">
        <p class="itorots__label">Pago 100% seguro</p>
        {%- comment -%}
          Aqui ponia Bizum, que no esta activo: se prometia en la portada y
          luego no aparecia al pagar. PayPal si lo esta (proveedor conectado,
          comprobado en la pantalla de pago), asi que se mantiene.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <p class="itorots__sub">Visa &middot; Mastercard &middot; PayPal &middot; Apple Pay</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="itorots__item">
      <div class="itorots__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="itorots__text">
        <p class="itorots__label">WhatsApp 624 150 603</p>
        <p class="itorots__sub">Lun–Vie 9–20h &middot; Respuesta en &lt; 2h</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{"name":"Strip de confianza","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"Strip de confianza"}]}
{% endschema %}
